---
import MainLayout from '@layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import { CLEAR_LINK, VERIFY_LINK, EXTERNAL_PROPS } from '@lib/links';
---
<MainLayout
  title="法人号码核验 - 企业法人手机号三要素校验"
  description="企业法人手机号实名认证，姓名+身份证+手机号三要素一致性校验，用于号码申诉主体核验，提高号码标记清除申诉的通过率。号码标记清除网提供法人号码核验科普与对接。"
  keywords="法人号码核验,法人手机号三要素校验,手机号实名认证核验,姓名身份证手机号一致性校验,号码申诉主体核验,企业法人身份验证"
  buildSchema="none"
>
  <div class="bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">法人号码核验服务</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">企业法人手机号三要素一致性校验，为号码申诉提供主体核验依据，提高申诉通过率</p>
      <a href={VERIFY_LINK} {...EXTERNAL_PROPS} class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl font-bold shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/25 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">
        进入号码核验
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5-5 5M6 12h12"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <!-- 什么是三要素核验 -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">什么是法人手机号三要素核验</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
        法人号码核验是对"姓名 + 身份证号 + 手机号"三项个人信息进行一致性校验的服务，即核验该手机号码是否由法人本人实名登记、登记信息与提供的身份信息是否一致。
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-5 text-center">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-blue-900 mb-1">姓名</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-blue-800">法人姓名</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-5 text-center">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-blue-900 mb-1">身份证号</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-blue-800">法人身份证号码</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-5 text-center">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-blue-900 mb-1">手机号</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-blue-800">企业号码持有人手机号</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4">
        三项信息同时校验且一致，核验即通过，可作为号码归属主体真实性的有效证明。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 用于号码申诉主体核验 -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">用于号码申诉的主体核验</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
        在号码被误标记后，向中国信通院、360、腾讯等平台提交"清除标记"申诉时，平台通常会要求证明该号码的真实归属主体。
        法人号码核验结果正是一种强有力的主体证明材料：
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
        <li class="flex items-start space-x-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
          <span>证明号码由法人本人实名登记，与申报主体一致</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start space-x-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
          <span>补充法人证件与归属信息，补全申诉材料清单</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start space-x-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
          <span>提高号码标记申诉的通过率与审核效率</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- 提高申诉通过率 -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">如何提高申诉通过率</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">在提交号码标记清除申诉前，建议完成以下核验与材料准备，以提升通过率：</p>
      <ol class="space-y-3 text-gray-700">
        <li class="flex items-start space-x-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium">1</span>
          <span>先行进行法人手机号三要素核验，确认主体一致性</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start space-x-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium">2</span>
          <span>准备好营业执照、经办人身份证、号码使用证明等材料</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start space-x-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium">3</span>
          <span>将核验结果与证明材料一并提交至各平台申诉入口</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start space-x-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium">4</span>
          <span>关注审核进度，必要时按要求补充说明</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <!-- 注意事项 -->
    <div class="bg-yellow-50 rounded-xl border border-yellow-200 p-6 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-yellow-600 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-yellow-900 mb-2">注意事项</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-yellow-800">
            法人号码核验仅用于号码归属主体真实性的确认，请在合法合规前提下使用本人或企业数据，
            切勿用于违法违规用途。本站仅提供相关科普与官方入口导航，核验结果请以服务商反馈为准。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 行动按钮 -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 rounded-2xl p-8 text-white text-center shadow-xl shadow-blue-500/20 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-400/25 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">需要法人号码核验？</h2>
      <p class="text-blue-100 mb-6">为您的号码申诉补齐主体核验材料，提升通过率</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a
          href={VERIFY_LINK}
          {...EXTERNAL_PROPS}
          class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-blue-700 px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all"
        >
          立即进行三要素核验
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5-5 5M6 12h12"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href={CLEAR_LINK}
          {...EXTERNAL_PROPS}
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-2 border-white/50 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white/70 transition-all"
        >
          前往号码标记清除
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>